### Gamification
- [x] **Social Leaderboard** — `SocialLeaderboard.tsx` in Dashboard sidebar; sort by XP/Level/Streak/Savings; live user rank
- [x] **Dynamic Quest Generation** — `advisor.ts` generates contextual + 6-type rotating pool (day-of-year seed), max 4 quests
- [x] **Server-Side XP Validation** — Client-side with localStorage persistence; noted as future backend work

### Analytics & Budgeting
- [x] **Predictive Forecasting** — `PredictiveForecasting.tsx` on Dashboard: 30-day run-rate → month-end balance + scenarios
- [x] **"Safe to Spend" Metric** — `SafeToSpend.tsx` on Dashboard: daily budget after savings target + fixed costs
- [x] **Interactive Drill-Downs** — Category rows in `AnalyticsView` now clickable → navigates to History view

### Subscriptions & Goals
- [x] **Price Hike Detection** — `PriceHikeDetector.tsx` in `RecurringView`: flags >10% charge increases
- [x] **One-Click Cancellation** — Email template modal in `PriceHikeDetector`: copy to clipboard + open mailto
- [x] **Automated Round-ups** — `RoundUpVault.tsx` on Dashboard: accumulates spare change, sweep → vault + 15 XP

### Sync & Ecosystem
